  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 22 April 2024). Our client Harish Srivastava is a 53-year-old government clerk who lives at Plot 35, Kothrud, Pune 411009 and can be reached on +91 87694 21184 or harish.srivastava@example.in. The client's PAN QPEPS3767L.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Crescent Traders. A cheque for ₹28,40,000 issued by M/s Crescent Traders bounced: the cheque came back with the remark account closed.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 798418146245 (IFSC KKBK0125946).\nThe matter was filed as CC/24/2024 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Pune on 26 August 2024.",
